0..67 Comment "//! This source records a dialogue between a seat and its operator."
68..71 Comment "//!"
72..122 Comment "//! The recorder orders moves from both endpoints."
123..159 Comment "//! The seat uses the left endpoint."
160..201 Comment "//! The operator uses the right endpoint."
202..255 Comment "//! The causal web gives the dialogue\'s logical time."
256..299 Comment "//! Each endpoint preserves its move order."
300..303 Comment "//!"
304..339 Comment "//! Each send precedes its receipt."
340..383 Comment "//! Two logs can commute independent moves."
384..421 Comment "//! These logs describe one dialogue."
422..486 Comment "//! `decompose` returns the web\'s modular decomposition as data."
487..490 Comment "//!"
491..536 Comment "//! - cites: [Mazurkiewicz-1987-trace_theory]"
537..595 Comment "//! - cites: [Gallai-1967-transitiv_orientierbare_graphen]"
596..599 Comment "//!"
600..707 Comment "//! [Mazurkiewicz-1987-trace_theory]: https://doi.org/10.1007/3-540-17906-2_30 \"Mazurkiewicz, Trace Theory\""
708..835 Comment "//! [Gallai-1967-transitiv_orientierbare_graphen]: https://doi.org/10.1007/BF02020961 \"Gallai, Transitiv orientierbare Graphen\""
